<!-- in verson 1.x TFP gave 80 points of resistance vs hot and cold temperatures to every outfit, rendering weather absolutely pointless. -->
<!-- Outfits aren't enviro-suits, they are just armor - so, with the exception of 5 cold resistance for lumberjack hat/coat, ALL these buffs have been removed -->

